  "package_version": "0.9.0",
  "patch_application": "Moved from Git b2aaa3e to b881cadb by a three-way merge per file (upstream b2aaa3e / upstream b881cadb / local patched files); the only conflicts were test placement in src/input/base/element.rs and src/slider.rs, resolved by taking upstream b881cadb order. Dropped because merged upstream: slider min above the default max (#3823), Slider::track_focus (#3824), a disabled SliderThumb (#3825), Dialog::accessibility_label (#3826), the input IME caret (#3827, was ime-anchor-patch.md), notifying an input moved by its parent (#3828, was input-move-patch.md), TimeField::separator (#3829) and publishing the input layout at the end of prepaint (#3831, was input-paint-patch.md); src/dialog.rs, src/time_field.rs, src/input/base/element.rs and src/input/base/state.rs equal upstream. src/text/node.rs and tests/block_surface.rs then took e58511d0 of material/text-block-surfaces. Every patched file equals b881cadb with the open PR branches material/motion-transition-playback, material/toolbar-vertical-axis, material/slider-accessibility-steps and material/text-block-surfaces merged onto it. Moved from Git bb85882 to b2aaa3e by a three-way merge (upstream bb85882 / upstream b2aaa3e / local patched files) without conflicts. The original five patch files were three-way merged (upstream Git / published registry 0.8.1 base / local patched registry files) without conflicts. The TransitionPlayback addition and the IME anchor (ime-anchor-patch.md) were made directly on this checkout afterwards; src/input/base/element.rs and state.rs were then replaced by the upstream PR branches material/input-ime-anchor and material/input-move-notify (both on b2aaa3e, combined without conflicts in code), and material/input-paint-no-write (on 2c150ee5) was applied on top, moving the move-notify comparison with the block it moves. src/text_selection.rs carries no patch any more and matches upstream. src/input/base/element.rs and state.rs then had upstream's IME caret report (#3827) removed by hand (ime-anchor-revert-patch.md).",
  "patch_base": {
